          "source_id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c",
          "quote": "The highwall shall be completely covered with spoil and the disturbed are a graded to comply with the provisions of § 715.14 of this chapter.",
